cutie-cpp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(cutie CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE cutie::cutie)

To enable TensorRT backend, install with:

    vcpkg install cutie-cpp[tensorrt]

Note: CUDA Toolkit must be installed on the system. For TensorRT, also set:
    export CUDA_DIR=/usr/local/cuda
    export TENSORRT_ROOT=/path/to/tensorrt
